  ],
  "notes": [
    "Fronius inverters with the Datamanager 2.0, read through SunSpec models (float models 111-113, 120-123, 160).",
    "Addresses are the register numbers printed in the manual (1-based): the first register, 40001, is sent on the wire as 40000.",
    "Register positions after the inverter model change with the SunSpec model type (float or integer with scale factors), selected in the Datamanager web interface or in register 216.",
    "A value the device cannot provide is returned as the unavailable value of its type (see sentinels).",
    "Generic Fronius inverter map for the default float setting."
  ],
